element 1 — the whole equation: matrix squared equals result matrix
1 eq
  lhs: element 2
  rhs: element 4

element 2 — left side: the matrix raised to the power 2
2 sup
  base: element 3
  exp: num  2

element 3 — the 2x2 matrix with entries a b / c d
3 mat
  - flat
    - ident  a
    - ident  b
  - flat
    - ident  c
    - ident  d

element 4 — the result matrix, 2 rows by 2 cells
4 mat
